"""A short-phrase detector, not a complete activation reconstruction.

The main negative pulses mark 'in ... way/form/manner/sense', 'in particular',
'in fact', Python's 'in range', and 'to know'. Modifiers weaken the pulse;
'of' can continue a representation phrase. A few conversation delimiters have
stable levels of their own; an anonymous stack-trace marker is positive.
Two Russian equivalents are included. Everything else is near zero.
State is the last six tokens and last prediction, reset at document boundaries.
"""

READS = ()

